(7690745, 1260313, 100831, '<td valign="top">Interesting processing choice on the monochrome, not nearly as much contrast (I would have expected the darks to be darker). But I like it. 8</td>', 'Interesting processing choice on the monochrome, not nearly as much contrast (I would have expected the darks to be darker). But I like it. 8', '2021-04-01 10:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
