(7691077, 1260351, 143116, '<td valign="top">Beautifully intricate shot, nicely stitched together. However, not too much difference in the B&amp;W and color versions</td>', 'Beautifully intricate shot, nicely stitched together. However, not too much difference in the B&W and color versions', '2021-04-05 08:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7691078, 1260239, 143116, '<td valign="top">A clear distinction and different mood, left and right. I like it!</td>', 'A clear distinction and different mood, left and right. I like it!', '2021-04-05 08:12:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7691079, 1260309, 143116, '<td valign="top">The symmetry in the gate really works! Personally, I might have tried to harshen the mood on the right, to contrast with the happy mood on the left. I didn''t see the soap bubbles until I looked more closely.</td>', 'The symmetry in the gate really works! Personally, I might have tried to harshen the mood on the right, to contrast with the happy mood on the left. I didn''t see the soap bubbles until I looked more closely.', '2021-04-05 08:15:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7691080, 1260210, 143116, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, but the difference between top and bottom is rather small. Oz and Kansas are pretty close ...</td>', 'Nice picture, but the difference between top and bottom is rather small. Oz and Kansas are pretty close ...', '2021-04-05 08:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7691081, 1260338, 143116, '<td valign="top">I like the different moods left and right - well done!</td>', 'I like the different moods left and right - well done!', '2021-04-05 08:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7691082, 1260157, 143116, '<td valign="top">Out of these two I think the B&amp;W is strongest - the color picture is a bit bland. What could you have done to make the color picture more powerful?</td>', 'Out of these two I think the B&W is strongest - the color picture is a bit bland. What could you have done to make the color picture more powerful?', '2021-04-05 08:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7691083, 1260355, 143116, '<td valign="top">He''s too fast!</td>', 'He''s too fast!', '2021-04-05 08:35:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7691084, 1260177, 143116, '<td valign="top">Great idea, well executed. I know this is a lot of work, but wouldn''t it be possible to have a (potentially different) pattern on the right? To me it now looks rather randowm.</td>', 'Great idea, well executed. I know this is a lot of work, but wouldn''t it be possible to have a (potentially different) pattern on the right? To me it now looks rather randowm.', '2021-04-05 08:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7691085, 1260320, 143116, '<td valign="top">I love puffins!</td>', 'I love puffins!', '2021-04-05 08:38:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7691089, 1260098, 143116, '<td valign="top">The color photo is great - but in the B&amp;W version is much harder to appreciate. Red and green are now virtually indistinguishable and the pattern on the board is competing with the crab.</td>', 'The color photo is great - but in the B&W version is much harder to appreciate. Red and green are now virtually indistinguishable and the pattern on the board is competing with the crab.', '2021-04-05 08:53:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7691091, 1260293, 143116, '<td valign="top">Intriguing how the B&amp;W version shows a much clearer separation between the branches and the water!</td>', 'Intriguing how the B&W version shows a much clearer separation between the branches and the water!', '2021-04-05 08:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7691132, 1260338, 114285, '<td valign="top">Feel this could be the winner. I love the way you have positioned your two photos. They could be twins pausing to reflect a thoughtful  statement.<br/> <br/>Really wonderful, I would be surprised if this did not get the blue.</td>', 'Feel this could be the winner. I love the way you have positioned your two photos. They could be twins pausing to reflect a thoughtful  statement. Really wonderful, I would be surprised if this did not get the blue.', '2021-04-06 00:43:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7691180, 1260320, 138630, '<td valign="top">Color hands down for me in this one.  Would be without the processing on the bw (esp grain in background) but that cinches it.  Still my top - or one of my top picks in what turned out to be a very cool challenge.</td>', 'Color hands down for me in this one.  Would be without the processing on the bw (esp grain in background) but that cinches it.  Still my top - or one of my top picks in what turned out to be a very cool challenge.', '2021-04-06 17:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7691181, 1260351, 138630, '<td valign="top">Very cool.  No real preference for color or bw but I especially like the way this came together.  Awesome perspective on source photo, too.</td>', 'Very cool.  No real preference for color or bw but I especially like the way this came together.  Awesome perspective on source photo, too.', '2021-04-06 17:41:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7691182, 1260338, 138630, '<td valign="top">This is probably my top pick.  I wish there wasn''t the scratched texture on the bw side - the black and white is enough for a story.  Speaking of which, I''d love to know what you were thinking when you put this together . . . what made you decide to put BW on the left and color on the right?  I can imagine a story from either arrangement . . . just interested in knowing what you were telling.</td>', 'This is probably my top pick.  I wish there wasn''t the scratched texture on the bw side - the black and white is enough for a story.  Speaking of which, I''d love to know what you were thinking when you put this together . . . what made you decide to put BW on the left and color on the right?  I can imagine a story from either arrangement . . . just interested in knowing what you were telling.', '2021-04-06 17:44:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7691183, 1260241, 138630, '<td valign="top">BW simply does not do this one justice, even though the conversion is excellent.  Not only are the natural colors rich and pleasing, they help separate this critter from the background which I think is essential.</td>', 'BW simply does not do this one justice, even though the conversion is excellent.  Not only are the natural colors rich and pleasing, they help separate this critter from the background which I think is essential.', '2021-04-06 17:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7691198, 1260236, 138630, '<td valign="top">Very clever the way the two halves work together to create a cohesive whole.</td>', 'Very clever the way the two halves work together to create a cohesive whole.', '2021-04-06 22:33:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7691203, 1260280, 173844, '<td valign="top">Like many of the wonderful entries, this image plays with time.  Black and white will usually feel older.  It''s a beautiful scene, magical is this light.  Admittedly, I''m drawn to the color version, but must keep in mind that the black and white version in actuality, assuming a real shift in time, was also in color.  It''s getting confusing.  But it''s fun to imagine having such a choice, hopefully not irrevocable.  And, oh, did I mention that this photo is really beautiful?<br/>One of three co-favorites.</td>', 'Like many of the wonderful entries, this image plays with time.  Black and white will usually feel older.  It''s a beautiful scene, magical is this light.  Admittedly, I''m drawn to the color version, but must keep in mind that the black and white version in actuality, assuming a real shift in time, was also in color.  It''s getting confusing.  But it''s fun to imagine having such a choice, hopefully not irrevocable.  And, oh, did I mention that this photo is really beautiful?One of three co-favorites.', '2021-04-06 23:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7691205, 1260338, 173844, '<td valign="top">A fascinating appraisal across time.  The man, elderly and almost biblical, seems to reflect on his life in different eras, marveling almost on who he really is.  The processing of the black and white to age it is crucial to its fullness, and adroitly managed.  The setting is simple enough to work in both time periods.  A mesmerizing image.<br/>One of three favorites of the challenge.</td>', 'A fascinating appraisal across time.  The man, elderly and almost biblical, seems to reflect on his life in different eras, marveling almost on who he really is.  The processing of the black and white to age it is crucial to its fullness, and adroitly managed.  The setting is simple enough to work in both time periods.  A mesmerizing image.One of three favorites of the challenge.', '2021-04-06 23:40:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7691206, 1260090, 173844, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful choice of image, and how startlingly strong it turns out to be.  This silhouette with highlights is a solid bulk of a being, with a few brushstrokes, so to speak, capturing dimension and mysterious character.  Kind of like a statue.  The background colors alone could make a noble flag.  Very impressive.<br/>One of three favorites of the challenge.</td>', 'What a wonderful choice of image, and how startlingly strong it turns out to be.  This silhouette with highlights is a solid bulk of a being, with a few brushstrokes, so to speak, capturing dimension and mysterious character.  Kind of like a statue.  The background colors alone could make a noble flag.  Very impressive.One of three favorites of the challenge.', '2021-04-06 23:48:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7691207, 1260241, 173844, '<td valign="top">Another beauty.  The grasshopper seems to be woven of life itself, worthy of an entire career''s study.  What''s marvelous in the black and white is the disappearance of green, more so than the fade out of browns.  The forms of the grasses now come into their own, the bokeh like northern or southern lights.  The grasshopper is now camouflaged and serene.  That''s putting quite a spin on it, but I''m on a roll.<br/>Fascinating.</td>', 'Another beauty.  The grasshopper seems to be woven of life itself, worthy of an entire career''s study.  What''s marvelous in the black and white is the disappearance of green, more so than the fade out of browns.  The forms of the grasses now come into their own, the bokeh like northern or southern lights.  The grasshopper is now camouflaged and serene.  That''s putting quite a spin on it, but I''m on a roll.Fascinating.', '2021-04-06 23:59:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7691210, 1260321, 173844, '<td valign="top">Lovely transition, carried by the woman''s insouciant air.  She treads that narrow path into the camera. The colors of the scene on the left are subtly luscious, especially the reds and blues.  She can hold her own in any world she chooses.</td>', 'Lovely transition, carried by the woman''s insouciant air.  She treads that narrow path into the camera. The colors of the scene on the left are subtly luscious, especially the reds and blues.  She can hold her own in any world she chooses.', '2021-04-07 00:04:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7691211, 1260236, 124815, '<td valign="top">Lev you are too kind for a king,</td>', 'Lev you are too kind for a king,', '2021-04-07 00:23:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7691212, 1260310, 124815, '<td valign="top">Fascinating , labyrinthian construction.</td>', 'Fascinating , labyrinthian construction.', '2021-04-07 00:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7691214, 1260112, 97225, '<td valign="top">Beautiful - I love the black and white version.</td>', 'Beautiful - I love the black and white version.', '2021-04-07 00:46:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7691215, 1260338, 97225, '<td valign="top">I LOVE this! 10</td>', 'I LOVE this! 10', '2021-04-07 00:47:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7691216, 1260041, 97225, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done. My pick for the red. There just happens to be one that I love more.</td>', 'Beautifully done. My pick for the red. There just happens to be one that I love more.', '2021-04-07 00:48:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7691217, 1260355, 173844, '<td valign="top">What I find provocative here, and maybe I''m fooling myself, is that the black and white version seems sharper than the color version.  More contrasty, too.  Kind of reverses the expectation that the seeming present is more at hand than the past, as we tend to view black and whites.  Also, the sense of the cyclist fleeing into his own time is engaging.<br/>Rewarding image.</td>', 'What I find provocative here, and maybe I''m fooling myself, is that the black and white version seems sharper than the color version.  More contrasty, too.  Kind of reverses the expectation that the seeming present is more at hand than the past, as we tend to view black and whites.  Also, the sense of the cyclist fleeing into his own time is engaging.Rewarding image.', '2021-04-07 00:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7691218, 1260310, 173844, '<td valign="top">Wonderful choice of image.  The lovely result comes off as a chalice, or an Olympic flame.  The sense that they''re growing out of one another is moving.  A delicate explication of the challenge.</td>', 'Wonderful choice of image.  The lovely result comes off as a chalice, or an Olympic flame.  The sense that they''re growing out of one another is moving.  A delicate explication of the challenge.', '2021-04-07 00:52:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7691219, 1260351, 173844, '<td valign="top">Dizzying, intricately ordered image.  The neatest aspect of the picture is that the central building hardly changes as it morphs from color into black and white.  The entire transition is modest and cinematic.  The roads and tracks smoothly lead into each other from one version to the other.  Beautifully integrated.</td>', 'Dizzying, intricately ordered image.  The neatest aspect of the picture is that the central building hardly changes as it morphs from color into black and white.  The entire transition is modest and cinematic.  The roads and tracks smoothly lead into each other from one version to the other.  Beautifully integrated.', '2021-04-07 00:57:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7691220, 1260177, 173844, '<td valign="top">What an amazing transition from analog, the color version, into the digital black and white.  A switcheroo from the usual expectation.</td>', 'What an amazing transition from analog, the color version, into the digital black and white.  A switcheroo from the usual expectation.', '2021-04-07 00:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7691223, 1260338, 114285, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on a new personal best and by a lot. Now I recall that you were the photographer, but at the time I did not know. Im pretty sure you have entered a similar photo before.<br/> <br/>This was one of those photos that as soon as I saw it, I knew it would be the winner!</td>', 'Congratulations on a new personal best and by a lot. Now I recall that you were the photographer, but at the time I did not know. Im pretty sure you have entered a similar photo before. This was one of those photos that as soon as I saw it, I knew it would be the winner!', '2021-04-07 01:07:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(7691224, 1260310, 68504, '<td valign="top">excellent interpretation.</td>', 'excellent interpretation.', '2021-04-07 01:12:02.000000', NULL, 0),
