(7691329, 1260338, 114285, '<td valign="top"><br/><b><u>I have to say that I am pleased that a photo taken with an iphone and quite straightforward processing can get some accolades proving that the most important camera is the one in hand. </u></b> <br/> <br/>The camera doesnt see the eye does. I have to admit I never thought of placing the entry side by side like you have. That was one of the reasons you also scored so well, subject matter helped too. Its funny I was sure I had seen this gentleman before. Wouldnt it be lovely if you met him again and handed him this photo.</td>', 'I have to say that I am pleased that a photo taken with an iphone and quite straightforward processing can get some accolades proving that the most important camera is the one in hand.   The camera doesnt see the eye does. I have to admit I never thought of placing the entry side by side like you have. That was one of the reasons you also scored so well, subject matter helped too. Its funny I was sure I had seen this gentleman before. Wouldnt it be lovely if you met him again and handed him this photo.', '2021-04-07 21:41:55.000000', NULL, 0),
